The components retain the original visual composition and selected algorithms.
Global state, local database types and data access were replaced by typed inputs,
ThemeExtension fields and callbacks. Money remains exact decimal wire strings;
chart weights are presentation ratios only. Localization uses Flutter gen-l10n.
The application name and branding use Monetae's own assets.
No original copyright notices have been removed or invented.

T-502 modifications (2026-10-09): configurable transaction details, daily headers
and presentation-only callbacks; optional custom SVG category artwork in the
existing card/chart composition. Brand SVGs are Monetae's own assets; the mock
house illustration is original synthetic artwork. Category catalog icons use
Flutter Material Icons (Apache-2.0); no Cashew category PNGs were copied.
flutter_svg is used to render vectors without HTML/DOM or a JavaScript runtime.

