These adaptations retain rounded cards, tinted budget headers, timeline markers,
linear progress with rounded ends, and objective icon composition. Native Flutter
scrolling replaces carousel_slider; no new dependencies. Server DTOs replace
local finance queries, global preferences and transaction counters. Labels retain
exact decimal strings; BigInt quotients supply bounded presentation geometry.
Liquid/shake effects, pending/shared overlays, navigation and daily allowances
are omitted. Material icons and original synthetic SVGs follow the T-502 notice.
